    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "it is generally associated with religion, \nself development and having
      a reason to wake \nup tomorrow. \nJean-Paul Sartre wrote about this in more
      detail, and I couldn't tell you all about it in one go, or we would be staying
      here for a long time. "
