    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "I tried to make it \ntransparent, it \nappeared clear as day\n "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0.69411767}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "I tried EVERYTHING but \nit didn't go away.\n "
