  nextGroup: {fileID: 1957729188}
  gapFrames: 6
  sentences:
  - text: "But there is also absurdism, which concentrates \non you guessed it, "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: 'The absurd. '
    tint: {r: 0.3914173, g: 0.27334282, b: 0.7584905, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "In a nutshell, it's basically embracing the ups and downs of life, without
      a purpose, living life just \nbecause you want to.  "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "For its fun and uncertainty, or for \nthe love of the game, as some might
      \nsay. "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "And yes, I know this wall is \nmisaligned from the rest. "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  loop: 0
